  "shortDescription": "Accept Crypto Payments & Donations in your GDevelop Games",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "The Official GDevelop Port of FreetimeSDK - Accept multiple cryptocurrencies (BTC, ETH, LTC, SOL, and more) for payments and donations directly in your games. Features include: USD-to-Crypto conversion, external wallet integration (Trust Wallet, MetaMask, etc.), real-time fee calculation, player profiles and leaderboards, and secure transaction processing.",
